InitialConnection: `43`
ClientReason: `LoggedInOtherLocation`
ProtocolConstant: `LOGGED_IN_OTHER_LOCATION`

This error may occur when you sign in to your Microsoft account from two different locations simultaneously. Please see [Mojang's guide](https://help.minecraft.net/hc/en-us/articles/360045828292) on how to resolve this issue.